  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (D): Under GASB Statement No. 34, paragraphs 106-109, fiduciary funds (including pension trust, investment trust, private-purpose trust, and custodial funds) are excluded from government-wide financial statements because the resources cannot be used for the government''s own programs. They are presented in separate fiduciary fund financial statements.
